      "y": 795,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "RP2350B  /  PGA2350 module\n\nShared 12-bit D-port (read/write all 5 latches)\n33 fast GPIO + 1 spare  \u00b7  PIO \u00d73 (12 SMs)\nCortex-M33 \u00d72  \u00b7  520 KB SRAM  \u00b7  16 MB QSPI flash\nI\u00b2C0 master  \u00b7  USB device controller",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": "AIncejlgnng0Imz0iMhi4",
      "originalText": "RP2350B  /  PGA2350 module\n\nShared 12-bit D-port (read/write all 5 latches)\n33 fast GPIO + 1 spare  \u00b7  PIO \u00d73 (12 SMs)\nCortex-M33 \u00d72  \u00b7  520 KB SRAM  \u00b7  16 MB QSPI flash\nI\u00b2C0 master  \u00b7  USB device controller",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
